==Battleground==
*3 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*5 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The infinite Gory Darks warrant either some offensive force that can keep killing them or a defensive force that can wall or stall them easily. Beware of Tackey if choosing a backliner to deal with this stage. Zackie Peng requires minimal or no investment to counter.

